  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the distinct roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
