  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the root, therefore&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>On squaring, both sides we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>On squaring, both sides we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>Multiply by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>27</mn></mfenced><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>24</mn></msup></math></p><p>Similarly,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>24</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>96</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mrow/><mn>24</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mn>24</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>52</mn></math><br />&nbsp;</p>",
